 "name": "PengPong 弹企鹅",
 "steam_appid": 2766910,
 "required_age": 0,
 "is_free": false,
 "controller_support": "full",
 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/6cb457961f1638a1ea918f4ead690727.poster.avif?t=1787648640\" width=608 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/6cb457961f1638a1ea918f4ead690727.webm?t=1787648640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/6cb457961f1638a1ea918f4ead690727.mp4?t=1787648640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>《弹企鹅 PengPong》</strong> 是一款弹幕射击 Roguelike 游戏。在这里，你想活命就得反弹各种武器和道具（管它是什么，弹就对了）。请记住：万物皆可弹，而且你得弹得漂亮。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>游戏特色：</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/f249029c201a05149406fe2c86112e65.poster.avif?t=1787648640\" width=608 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/f249029c201a05149406fe2c86112e65.webm?t=1787648640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/f249029c201a05149406fe2c86112e65.mp4?t=1787648640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>生存挑战：</strong> 利用不同角色与武器的奇妙组合，在重重包围中活到最后。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >弹射才是硬道理：关键不在于直接打击，而在于利用物理反弹。冰球、手枪（拿来扔的那种！）、耳机（没错，耳机也弹！），甚至是河豚……去弹射这堆奇葩玩意儿吧！找准角度，让它们再飞一会儿。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>命运的回旋木马：</strong> 每一波结束后都要面临抉择：是签下残酷的契约，还是去赌场梭哈，或者是老老实实逛逛商店？</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/ea2953c6ebf0ea3f5aebbfb079864fda.poster.avif?t=1787648640\" width=608 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/ea2953c6ebf0ea3f5aebbfb079864fda.webm?t=1787648640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/ea2953c6ebf0ea3f5aebbfb079864fda.mp4?t=1787648640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>无限可能性：</strong> 超多道具，为你带来无穷的组合潜力与不可控的变数。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>争霸排行榜：</strong> 用你的最高分在全球玩家面前证明，谁才是真正的反弹大师。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>既可爱又诡异：</strong> 沉浸在充满质感的复古动画世界观中，感受那份“可爱又迷人”的诡异氛围。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/c597ac912aeb3b82ae1dde013febb1ee.poster.avif?t=1787648640\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/c597ac912aeb3b82ae1dde013febb1ee.webm?t=1787648640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/c597ac912aeb3b82ae1dde013febb1ee.mp4?t=1787648640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >去赌场里大赚一笔吧！运气好的话，游戏难度可能会直线下降。但千万别误会！<strong>《弹企鹅 PengPong》</strong> 可不是什么赌博模拟器，它是一款以可爱企鹅为主角的弹幕射击 Roguelike 游戏。<i>大概吧。</i></p>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/6cb457961f1638a1ea918f4ead690727.poster.avif?t=1787648640\" width=608 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/6cb457961f1638a1ea918f4ead690727.webm?t=1787648640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/6cb457961f1638a1ea918f4ead690727.mp4?t=1787648640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>《弹企鹅 PengPong》</strong> 是一款弹幕射击 Roguelike 游戏。在这里，你想活命就得反弹各种武器和道具（管它是什么，弹就对了）。请记住：万物皆可弹，而且你得弹得漂亮。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>游戏特色：</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/f249029c201a05149406fe2c86112e65.poster.avif?t=1787648640\" width=608 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/f249029c201a05149406fe2c86112e65.webm?t=1787648640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/f249029c201a05149406fe2c86112e65.mp4?t=1787648640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>生存挑战：</strong> 利用不同角色与武器的奇妙组合，在重重包围中活到最后。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >弹射才是硬道理：关键不在于直接打击，而在于利用物理反弹。冰球、手枪（拿来扔的那种！）、耳机（没错，耳机也弹！），甚至是河豚……去弹射这堆奇葩玩意儿吧！找准角度，让它们再飞一会儿。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>命运的回旋木马：</strong> 每一波结束后都要面临抉择：是签下残酷的契约，还是去赌场梭哈，或者是老老实实逛逛商店？</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/ea2953c6ebf0ea3f5aebbfb079864fda.poster.avif?t=1787648640\" width=608 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/ea2953c6ebf0ea3f5aebbfb079864fda.webm?t=1787648640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/ea2953c6ebf0ea3f5aebbfb079864fda.mp4?t=1787648640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>无限可能性：</strong> 超多道具，为你带来无穷的组合潜力与不可控的变数。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>争霸排行榜：</strong> 用你的最高分在全球玩家面前证明，谁才是真正的反弹大师。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>既可爱又诡异：</strong> 沉浸在充满质感的复古动画世界观中，感受那份“可爱又迷人”的诡异氛围。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/c597ac912aeb3b82ae1dde013febb1ee.poster.avif?t=1787648640\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/c597ac912aeb3b82ae1dde013febb1ee.webm?t=1787648640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766910/extras/c597ac912aeb3b82ae1dde013febb1ee.mp4?t=1787648640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >去赌场里大赚一笔吧！运气好的话，游戏难度可能会直线下降。但千万别误会！<strong>《弹企鹅 PengPong》</strong> 可不是什么赌博模拟器，它是一款以可爱企鹅为主角的弹幕射击 Roguelike 游戏。<i>大概吧。</i></p>",
 "short_description": "《弹企鹅 PengPong》 是一款弹幕射击 Roguelike 游戏。只不过，我们又往里加了点物理弹射的佐料以及需要一点运气点缀的……变数。",
 "supported_languages": "英语, 韩语, 日语, 简体中文, 繁体中文, 法语, 德语, 西班牙语 - 西班牙",
 "reviews": "“Adds a creative twist to the survivor shooter formula — feels fresh and addictive.”<br>G.Round<br><br>“By combining Cuphead-like visual flair with survivor-shooter progression and a unique ricochet-based combat feel, PengPong delivers a fresh sense of impact within a familiar genre space.”<br>Game*Spark<br><br>“Layering classic roguelite action with bold hockey-stick combat, vintage-cartoon presentation, and playful slot-style pacing, PengPong carves out a personality that feels immediately distinctive.”<br>AUTOMATON JP<br>",
